  "name": "SPIE-AAPM Lung CT Challenge",
  "alternateName": [
    "spie_aapm_lung_ct_challenge"
  ],
  "description": "As part of the 2015 SPIE Medical Imaging Conference, SPIE \u2013 with the support of American Association of Physicists in Medicine (AAPM) and the National Cancer Institute (NCI) \u2013 conducted a \u201cGrand Challenge\u201d on quantitative image analysis methods for the diagnostic classification of malignant and benign lung nodules. The LUNGx Challenge provided a unique opportunity for participants to compare their algorithms to those of others from academia, industry, and government in a structured, direct way using the same data sets. Please see the SPIE-AAPM Lung CT Challenge page to learn more about the images and to obtain any supporting metadata for this collection.",
